{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36305","headline":"路入剡中作 · 方干","name":"路入剡中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"截湾冲濑片帆通，高枕微吟到剡中。\n掠草并飞怜燕子，停桡独饮学渔翁。\n波涛漫撼长潭月，杨柳斜牵一岸风。\n便拟乘槎应去得，仙源直恐接星东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36305.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36305","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}